      "title": "搶槓 Robbing the Kong",
      "cite": "RULING HK8a/HK19 · Family A 香港蔴雀食糊牌型 / 香港麻雀常用番種 「即可搶其槓食糊並多加一番」 · Family B mahjong.wikidot Hong Kong Old Style \"Robbing the Kong | 1\" · Family C 香港麻雀協會 official rules · Family E English Wikipedia, Old Hong Kong",
      "note": "The robbable kong is a 加槓 — a fourth tile added to a pung already on the table — so three copies are locked in the robbed player's meld and the winner can hold exactly one: the robbed one. Here it completes a chow, which is the only thing a single tile can do. Settled like any other discard win (HK19); Family C's 搶槓當自摸 alternative is not modelled.",
